## Known Limits

{% aside type="note" title="Known Limits" %}
- `RERANK` is cloud-only
- MMR doesn't apply to `USING SPARSE` or `RECOMMEND`
- `OFFSET` incompatible with `GROUP BY`
- Local sparse weighting differs from Python FastEmbed BM25
{% /aside %}

